sequenceDiagram
    participant OrderService
    participant EventBus
    participant InventoryService
    participant PaymentService

    OrderService->>EventBus: OrderCreated
    EventBus->>InventoryService: OrderCreated
    InventoryService->>EventBus: InventoryReserved
    EventBus->>PaymentService: InventoryReserved
    PaymentService->>EventBus: PaymentProcessed
    EventBus->>OrderService: PaymentProcessed

    Note over EventBus: Reversible reserve first,<br/>charge second.<br/>No application coordinator
